为误中者","evidence":["fangji-q-d72af44abad594d13030"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["fangji-q-d72af44abad594d13030"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-d72af44abad594d13030","order":6070}],"persons":[{"id":"fangji-p-ecb23577738870","name":"倪氏（清河太守）","evidence":["fangji-q-d8f1730852cfc1bd6e0f","fangji-q-a1ab6503daca7ec98179","fangji-q-d72af44abad594d13030"],"facts":[],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"fangji-q-a1ab6503daca7ec98179","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-50832967b383593423bb","layer":"pei","quote":"谈高信寡，相为忧之。’于是便留辂，往请府丞及清河令。若夜雨者，当为啖二百斤犊肉；若不雨，当住十日。辂曰：‘言念费损","attribution":"裴注·辂别传","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":436,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e8b494523b85f66134ef","start":204,"end":261,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-d72af44abad594d13030","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-50832967b383593423bb","layer":"pei","quote":"至日向暮，了无云气，众人并嗤辂。辂言：‘树上已有少女微风，树间又有阴鸟和鸣；又少男风起，众鸟和翔，其应至矣！’须臾，果有艮风鸣鸟；日未入，东南有山云楼起；黄昏之后，雷声动天；到鼓一中，星月皆没，风云并兴，玄气四合，大雨河倾。倪调辂言：‘误中耳！不为神也。’辂曰：‘误中与天期，不亦工乎","attribution":"裴注·辂别传","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":436,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e8b494523b85f66134ef","start":263,"end":405,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-d8f1730852cfc1bd6e0f","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-ddd35389fdfa3c204e0a","layer":"original","quote":"后得休〖12〗，过清河倪太守。时天旱，倪问辂雨期。辂曰：“今夕当雨。”是日畅燥〖13〗，昼无形似〖14〗；府丞及令在坐〖15〗，咸谓不然。到鼓一中〖16〗，星月皆没；风云并起，竟成快雨〖17〗。于是倪盛修主人礼〖18〗，共为欢乐","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":414,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
